<title>USA: McLeodUSA sells $225 mln 144a snr notes.</title>
<headline>McLeodUSA sells $225 mln 144a snr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from McLeodUSA Inc was priced Tuesday via lead manager Salomon Brothers Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>The deal was increased to $225 million from an original size of $175 million, sources added.</p>
<p>McLeodUSA, based in Cedar Rapids, Iowa, is a competitive local exchange carrier.</p>
<p>BORROWER MCLEODUSA INC</p>
<p>AMT $225 MLN	 COUPON 9.25 PCT   MATURITY 7/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD  9.25 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD +298 BPS   CALLABLE  NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
